"description":"Strox – The Maintenance Your Bike Deserves\n\nStrox is a universal app that helps riders track and manage their motorcycle maintenance with clarity and confidence. Whether you ride for fun, compete, or commute daily, Strox keeps your bike in top shape — without the hassle.\n\nSmarter Maintenance Tracking  \nLog your engine hours or mileage — Strox will handle the rest. It automatically calculates when key service items like:\n\n- Oil changes  \n- Air filter cleaning  \n- Chain adjustments  \n… and more are due, based on your input.\n\nNever Miss a Service Again  \nStay ahead of maintenance with customizable reminders. Get notified before service is due so your bike keeps running like new.\n\nTailored to Your Ride  \nWhether you ride dirt bikes, sport tourers, or dual-sports, you can fully customize your maintenance schedule:\n\n- Add your own service items  \n- Choose interval types (hours or km/mi)  \n- Track what matters most to your bike and style\n\nYour Full Maintenance History  \nSee everything at a glance:  \n- What was done  \n- When it was done  \nPerfect for resale confidence or just peace of mind.\n\nClean UI. Built for Real Riders.  \nStrox ditches clutter for simplicity. Add logs in seconds, check upcoming tasks, and manage one or multiple bikes — all from a clear, intuitive interface.\n\n\n\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.strox.app/privacy", "sellerUrl":"https://www.strox.app", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"12+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "minimumOsVersion":"15.1", "userRatingCount":0}]
